{"ast":null,"code":"import{useState}from'react';export const useAlert=()=>{const[alert,setAlert]=useState(null);const showAlert=(type,message)=>{setAlert({type,message});};const clearAlert=()=>{setAlert(null);};return{alert,showAlert,clearAlert};};","map":{"version":3,"names":["useState","useAlert","alert","setAlert","showAlert","type","message","clearAlert"],"sources":["D:/Masters/Desarrollo Web Integral/frontend-biblioteca-digital/src/hooks/useAlert.js"],"sourcesContent":["import { useState } from 'react';\r\n\r\nexport const useAlert = () => {\r\n  const [alert, setAlert] = useState(null);\r\n\r\n  const showAlert = (type, message) => {\r\n    setAlert({ type, message });\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  const clearAlert = () => {\r\n    setAlert(null);\r\n  };\r\n\r\n  return {\r\n    alert,\r\n    showAlert,\r\n    clearAlert\r\n  };\r\n};\r\n"],"mappings":"AAAA,OAASA,QAAQ,KAAQ,OAAO,CAEhC,MAAO,MAAM,CAAAC,QAAQ,CAAGA,CAAA,GAAM,CAC5B,KAAM,CAACC,KAAK,CAAEC,QAAQ,CAAC,CAAGH,QAAQ,CAAC,IAAI,CAAC,CAExC,KAAM,CAAAI,SAAS,CAAGA,CAACC,IAAI,CAAEC,OAAO,GAAK,CACnCH,QAAQ,CAAC,CAAEE,IAAI,CAAEC,OAAQ,CAAC,CAAC,CAC7B,CAAC,CAED,KAAM,CAAAC,UAAU,CAAGA,CAAA,GAAM,CACvBJ,QAAQ,CAAC,IAAI,CAAC,CAChB,CAAC,CAED,MAAO,CACLD,KAAK,CACLE,SAAS,CACTG,UACF,CAAC,CACH,CAAC","ignoreList":[]},"metadata":{},"sourceType":"module","externalDependencies":[]}